    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, I get that. But my kid is also seeing a lot of arguments online from people who say that biological sex is the only important factor and that gender identity is just a social construct rather than something scientific. How does the scientific community respond to those specific arguments? Are those views considered scientifically valid or are they just dismissed?",
