    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It sounds like the scientific community has basically shut that debate down then. So basically, anyone claiming that sex is the only defining factor is just objectively wrong according to the research? It feels like there isn't really a \"scientific\" way to argue the other side if the consensus is already that settled.",
